OL,3,GNEWSAHow moves to 'de-pave' town could
OL,4,Acut flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #380,000 is being spent in
OL,7,FOswestry to help reduce the effects of
OL,8,Fflash flooding.
OL,10,FRather than flood defences, it will
OL,11,Ffocus on natural measures designed to
OL,12,F"de-pave" the north Shropshire town and
OL,13,Fhelp water soak into the ground more
OL,14,Feasily.
OL,16,FThe project is one of eight being
OL,17,Fsupported through the Severn Valley
OL,18,FWater Management Scheme, which is run
OL,19,Fby the Environment Agency, Shropshire
OL,20,FCouncil and a number of bodies in
OL,21,FWales.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
