OL,3,GNEWSAHow moves to 'de-pave' town could
OL,4,Acut flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn this case, raised flower beds will
OL,7,Fbe built alongside rain gardens -
OL,8,Fshallow, planted areas that are
OL,9,Fdesigned to capture, hold, and
OL,10,Fnaturally absorb water run-off.
